		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>8-foot-tall, grey-robed, veiled figure made of foamy flesh. Avatar of Yog-Sothoth.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 82, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +10 (2d8 + statis), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +5, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 17</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Command Ancient Ones</strong>. As an action, summon 1d4 loyal hunduns, who appear for 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Madness</strong>. Warps reality for all mortals within far. Each turn, WIS 18+ or staggered 1d6 rounds. On success, immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Only damaged by magic sources. If destroyed, reappears somewhere else in the universe immediately.</p><p></p><p><strong>Statis</strong>. CHA 18+ or trapped in a crystalline time bubble, repeat check once per day; ends on success.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
